# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AI Research Software Repository
# Keep research code, benchmarks, datasets, notebooks, evaluation artifacts,
# model cards, figures, reports, and reproducible experiment assets versioned.
# Exclude local assistant instructions, scratch state, secrets, caches, and noise.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

